msgid "Puts the selected clipboard history entry on the system clipboard"
msgstr "将所选剪贴板历史记录放入系统剪贴板"

#. Translators: Input help description for saving a clipboard image.
#: addon\globalPlugins\nvdaClipboard\__init__.py:329
msgid "Saves the clipboard image to a file"
msgstr "将剪贴板图像保存到文件"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:33
msgid ""
"NVDA Clipboard adds accessible navigation and bounded SQLite history for the "
"Windows clipboard.\n"
"History supports Unicode text with optional HTML or RTF, PNG or DIB images, "
"mixed text and images, and real file groups, with user categories and a type-"
"aware manager.\n"
"Commands can append or temporarily paste NVDA's last spoken text.\n"
"Optional Tiantan Clipboard synchronization uploads only permitted Unicode "
"text."
msgstr ""
"剪贴板为 Windows 剪贴板提供无障碍浏览和容量受限的 SQLite 历史记录。\n"
"历史记录支持 Unicode 文本及可选的 HTML 或 RTF 格式、PNG 或 DIB 图像、文本与图"
"像混合内容和原生文件组，并提供用户类别及可识别内容类型的管理器。\n"
"相关命令可以追加或临时粘贴 NVDA 最后朗读的文本。\n"
"可选的天坦剪贴板同步仅上传符合要求的 Unicode 文本。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:41
msgid ""
"### 0.1.0\n"
"\n"
"Initial development release with accessible clipboard navigation, bounded "
"SQLite history, a type-aware manager, image and file support, last-spoken "
"text commands, and optional cloud synchronization."
msgstr ""
"### 0.1.0\n"
"\n"
"首次开发版本，包含无障碍剪贴板浏览、容量受限的 SQLite 历史记录、类型感知管理"
"器、图像和文件支持、最后朗读文本命令以及可选的云同步。"

